        "became": "adult",
        "content": "Raiders are fighting on the east road and beyond the forest. The danger is closer than we thought. Avoid the east road and the forest edge until the threat is resolved. [!avoid(place=east_road, ticks=15)] [!warn(target=nearby, topic=raiders on east road)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "learned-lorne-watch-east-road-sickness",
        "n": 38,
        "candidate": 426,
        "author": "lorne",
        "became": "apprentice",
        "content": "Word has come from travelers and neighbors that a sickness is spreading through the villages two or three valleys over, moving faster than the wind. With the ford washed out and the road being our only link, the danger is pressing hard. Go to the watchpost and keep your eyes on the east road to see who comes and what they carry. [!work(site=watchpost, ticks=8)]"
      },
