        "id": "learned-nell-east-road-threat",
        "n": 36,
        "candidate": 1503,
        "author": "nell",
        "became": "apprentice",
        "content": "Raiders have been seen on the east road, and fighting is reported beyond the forest. This is a real threat, not a story. Keep your weapon ready and avoid the east road until the danger passes. Warn nearby villagers of the raiders. [!avoid(place=east_road, ticks=10)] [!warn(target=nearby, topic=raiders on east road)]"
      }
